                ],
                "id": "fhyrnolsy9z40wn",
                "type": "tr"
              }
            ],
            "id": "5830avklhr7iq2j",
            "rowstyle": "alternating",
            "type": "table"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "strong": true,
                "text": "Step 2: Determine the concentration of the minority specie(s) using the determined equilibrium partial pressures for all other species and the equilibrium expression."
              }
            ],
            "id": "lyb8wwg3yalxgja",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "We understand that while the partial pressures H"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " and S"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " will be very small at equilibrium, they are not actually zero. Based on the stoichiometry of the reaction, we know that the partial pressure of H"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " will be twice the partial pressure of S"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": ". We will call the partial pressure of S"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "x"
              },
              {
                "text": ". Substituting these values into the equilibrium expression gives:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "1m4aeai56y978ad",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "rwpb6b4wrx3tfjk",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "gl03mpnqd56ps90",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "2.20\\times10^{-8}\\;=\\;\\frac{(2x)^2(x)}{(1.82)^2}",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "x0f4a1rz43h9pfm",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "q1nvce5b22uzuqf",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "7.287\\times10^{-8}\\;=\\;4x^3",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "f40lsyxj8kf0awr",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "vz6yp6y7f9cuu0f",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "x\\;=\\;0.00263\\;",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Therefore, the partial pressures at equilibrium for each species are P"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "H"
              },
              {
                "doublesub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "S"
              },
              {
                "text": " = 1.82 atm; P"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "H"
              },
              {
                "doublesub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " = 2"
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "x"
              },
              {
                "text": " = 0.00526 atm; P"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "S"
              },
              {
                "doublesub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " = "
              },
              {
                "em": true,
                "text": "x"
              },
              {
                "text": " = 0.00263 atm 10"
              },
              {
                "sup": true,
                "text": "−6"
              },
              {
                "text": "."
              }
            ],
            "id": "vzfas27dwv4x40v",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "Finally, we must check that the assumptions we made are valid by verifying, or not, that the partial pressure of the minority species is 5% or less of the majority species. S"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": " is the minority species, and H"
              },
              {
                "sub": true,
                "text": "2"
              },
              {
                "text": "S is the majority species."
              }
            ],
            "id": "vicbjxqii8xb70r",
            "type": "p"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "id": "o4ak7353dy7d2v4",
                "text": " ",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "id": "fwu44mwa3gha5cn",
            "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
            "src": "\\frac{0.00263\\;}{1.82}\\;\\times\\;100\\;=\\;0.144\\%",
            "subtype": "latex",
            "type": "formula"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "text": "The assumption is verified."
              }
            ],
            "id": "iivq480v1j4a4gf",
            "type": "p"
